44	 *   ui.pause() / ui.resume() / ui.menu.toggle()
45	 *   ui.debugState('combat'|'menu'|'clean')
46	 *
47	 * ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
48	 * WHAT THIS SUBSYSTEM READS FROM OTHERS (all optional, all duck-typed)
49	 * ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
50	 *   weapons.getHudState() -> { name, mode, ammo, reserve, magSize, reloading,
