2	 * play — browserless GAMEPLAY probe.
3	 *
4	 * The rest of the CLI measures the renderer. This measures the *game*: does the
5	 * crouch key actually crouch, does a slide start, does the player die at 0 HP,
6	 * does health come back, do the enemies move. All of it against the real engine
7	 * booted in Node (see harness.mjs) — no browser, headless or otherwise.
